{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28038","headline":"题雁塔 · 许玫","name":"题雁塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝轮金地压人寰，独坐苍冥啓玉关。\n北岭风烟开魏阙，南轩气象镇商山。\n灞陵车马垂杨里，京国城池落照间。\n蹔放尘心游物外，六街钟鼓又催还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许玫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}